## 4. Model providers

The Software sends your requests and the parts of your project it works with to the model
provider you choose (for example OpenAI, Anthropic or Google, or a server you run). That use is
governed by your agreement with that provider. The author does not receive this data. The
Software collects no telemetry; checking for updates is a plain request to the releases page.

